      "desc": "Replaces <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Full Firepower</color> with <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Full Firepower - Modified</color>. This <color=#2BAD00>decreases the rate of fire to increase bullet power</color>. Upon activating this skill, Billy will <color=#2BAD00>directly enter Crouching Shot</color>, triggering <color=#FFFFFF>Core Passive: Steady Shot</color> and <color=#2BAD00>increasing his DMG dealt by an additional 50%</color>. The buff will end when he moves, returns to idle, or is knocked back or launched.",
